flowchart TB
    Start([User prompt]) --> Classify{Router node<br/>condition:if}

    Classify -->|needs_code| Code[Code search branch]
    Classify -->|needs_docs| Docs[Docs search branch]

    Code --> C1[Search repository]
    Docs --> D1[Search memory store]

    C1 --> C2[Extract snippets]
    D1 --> D2[Retrieve passages]

    C2 --> Merge
    D2 --> Merge

    Merge[Merge results] --> Synthesize[Synthesize answer]
    Synthesize --> Output[Return cited result]

    style Start fill:#151517,stroke:#ec4899,stroke-width:2px
    style Output fill:#151517,stroke:#ec4899,stroke-width:2px
    style Classify fill:#1c1c1f,stroke:#ec4899
    style Merge fill:#1c1c1f,stroke:#ec4899
